=== Q2: transitivity -- corr(Q_cyl, log H) over the winding cube ===
  n=6 (cube 2^9): corr(Q_cyl, log H) = -0.6407 [book model S50 gave -0.76]
    all-aligned (transitive-ish) Q = 9; global min Q = 3 at H = [41]; max-H tournaments' Q = [5, 6, 13, 14, 15]
    H at all-aligned = 1; H range on cube = [1, 45]
  n=7 (cube 2^12): corr(Q_cyl, log H) = -0.6567 [book model S50 gave -0.59]
    all-aligned (transitive-ish) Q = 19; global min Q = 9 at H = [105, 123, 151]; max-H tournaments' Q = [10]
    H at all-aligned = 1; H range on cube = [1, 175]
